<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - Bahia Sul upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bahia Sul upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said in a report it was upgrading Brazilian pulp and paper maker Bahia Sul to buy from sell.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Paulo Vasconcellos said its rating was based on positive developments expected to occur following the privatization of state mining giant Vale do Rio Doce.</p>
</text>
